ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years, same as April to May. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 158% of normal in April to May and 42% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 23% on the middle of the grids. On grid 21766 the driest year was 1953, at 62% of normal.</p>"}
